+  // The slot counts tabs that are not this row. A row already in the folder
+  // is still moved: CanMoveTabsIntoFolder allows it, and MoveTabImpl or
+  // MoveCollectionImpl takes one off the child index when that row sits
+  // before the destination. Counting the row here would land it one slot
+  // early (BACKLOG S-137).
